WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.812
Peter jumped out of the watering can.

2
00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:22.136
"Hey!" cried the farmer.

3
00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:30.603
Peter ran and ran.

4
00:00:30.604 --> 00:00:39.488
Finally the farmer stopped chasing him.

5
00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:43.971
Now Peter was lost.

6
00:00:43.972 --> 00:00:47.777
"Where's the gate?" he asked a mouse.

7
00:00:47.778 --> 00:01:00.098
But the mouse ran away.

8
00:01:00.099 --> 00:01:05.536
Suddenly Peter gasped. "A cat!"

9
00:01:05.537 --> 00:01:09.850
The cat was watching fish in the pond.

10
00:01:09.851 --> 00:01:13.883
She didn't see Peter.

11
00:01:13.884 --> 00:01:17.157
"Whew!" whispered Peter.

12
00:01:17.158 --> 00:01:24.189
He quietly slipped away.

13
00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:29.468
"I must find the gate!" said Peter.

14
00:01:29.469 --> 00:01:32.045
Scritch, scratch!

15
00:01:32.046 --> 00:01:36.413
Peter heard a noise.

16
00:01:36.414 --> 00:01:41.200
He climbed onto a wheelbarrow to see.

17
00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:45.288
The farmer was working in the onion patch.

18
00:01:45.289 --> 00:01:49.923
Scritch, scratch!

19
00:01:49.924 --> 00:01:55.533
Then Peter saw something else.

20
00:01:55.534 --> 00:02:01.206
"The gate!" he cried.

21
00:02:01.207 --> 00:02:07.716
Peter shot across the garden.

22
00:02:07.717 --> 00:02:12.120
The farmer chased him. "Stop, rabbit!"

23
00:02:12.121 --> 00:02:14.746
But Peter was too fast.

24
00:02:14.747 --> 00:02:26.202
He squeezed under the gate and ran home.

25
00:02:26.203 --> 00:02:30.888
Mrs. Rabbit scolded Peter. "Naughty rabbit!

26
00:02:30.889 --> 00:02:38.874
You lost your jacket and shoes!"

27
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:44.266
The other bunnies ate bread and blackberries.

28
00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:47.203
But Peter didn't get any.

29
00:02:47.204 --> 00:03:00.001
Peter sneezed.

30
00:03:00.002 --> 00:03:09.216
Mrs. Rabbit gave him medicine.

31
00:03:09.217 --> 00:03:27.589
Then she sent him to bed.

